IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-HARVARD-LEGENDRE-RECURRENCE.

DATA DIVISION.
01 D0-SUBSTRATE-TRUNK.
   05 D0-MOTZKIN-PRIME     PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
   05 D0-K-EXPONENT        PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
   05 D0-MAX-DEGREE        PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 D1-HBRIDGE-INPUT.
   05 D1-INPUT-COORD-Q16   PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.
   05 D1-GATING-WMQ        PIC 9(9) USAGE R4.
   05 D1-GATED-COORD       PIC 9(9) USAGE R5.
01 D2-RECURRENCE-STAGE.
   05 D2-POLY-PREV         PIC 9(9) USAGE R6.
   05 D2-POLY-CURR         PIC 9(9) USAGE R7.
   05 D2-POLY-NEXT         PIC 9(9) USAGE R8.
01 D3-LEAF-EVAL.
   05 D3-PROOF-RULING      PIC 9(9) USAGE R9.
   05 D3-DISP-WRAP-MOD     PIC 9(9) USAGE R10.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    MOVE 953467954 TO D0-MOTZKIN-PRIME.
    MOVE 3 TO D0-K-EXPONENT.
    MOVE 4 TO D0-MAX-DEGREE.
    MOVE 32768 TO D1-INPUT-COORD-Q16.

    PERFORM EVAL-HBRIDGE-GATING.
    PERFORM COMPUTE-LEGENDRE-RECURRENCE.
    PERFORM SYNC-DISPLACEMENT.

    IF D2-POLY-CURR <= 66048
        MOVE 0 TO D3-PROOF-RULING
        SET depth 4
    ELSE
        MOVE 4 TO D3-PROOF-RULING
        SET depth 1
    END-IF.

    EVAL.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

EVAL-HBRIDGE-GATING.
    comment G_wmq = 875 + (125 * 65536) / (65536 + (x * 100 / 1000));
    COMPUTE D1-GATING-WMQ = 875 + ((125 * 65536) / (65536 + ((D1-INPUT-COORD-Q16 * 100) / 1000))).
    COMPUTE D1-GATED-COORD = (D1-INPUT-COORD-Q16 * D1-GATING-WMQ) / 1000.
    EXIT.

COMPUTE-LEGENDRE-RECURRENCE.
    comment P_0 = 65536 (1.0), P_1 = gated_coord;
    MOVE 65536 TO D2-POLY-PREV.
    MOVE D1-GATED-COORD TO D2-POLY-CURR.

    comment n=1 step -> P_2 = (3*x*P_1 - P_0) / 2;
    COMPUTE D2-POLY-NEXT = ((3 * ((D1-GATED-COORD * D2-POLY-CURR) / 65536)) - D2-POLY-PREV) / 2.
    MOVE D2-POLY-CURR TO D2-POLY-PREV.
    MOVE D2-POLY-NEXT TO D2-POLY-CURR.

    comment n=2 step -> P_3 = (5*x*P_2 - 2*P_1) / 3;
    COMPUTE D2-POLY-NEXT = ((5 * ((D1-GATED-COORD * D2-POLY-CURR) / 65536)) - (2 * D2-POLY-PREV)) / 3.
    MOVE D2-POLY-CURR TO D2-POLY-PREV.
    MOVE D2-POLY-NEXT TO D2-POLY-CURR.

    comment n=3 step -> P_4 = (7*x*P_3 - 3*P_2) / 4;
    COMPUTE D2-POLY-NEXT = ((7 * ((D1-GATED-COORD * D2-POLY-CURR) / 65536)) - (3 * D2-POLY-PREV)) / 4.
    MOVE D2-POLY-CURR TO D2-POLY-PREV.
    MOVE D2-POLY-NEXT TO D2-POLY-CURR.
    EXIT.

SYNC-DISPLACEMENT.
    COMPUTE D3-DISP-WRAP-MOD = D2-POLY-CURR - ((D2-POLY-CURR / 256) * 256).
    EXIT.

END-STRATEGY.
